CLASS com/charlesproxy/ssl/class_991 com/charlesproxy/ssl/IOSCertificateArgs
	COMMENT [charles4] Charles 4's com.xk72.charles.ssl.IOSCertificateArgs, field for field. The
	COMMENT hard-coded tset constant decodes to an empty-array plist, and the four constructor
	COMMENT arguments arrive in the order class_1002 computes them. Together these are the columns
	COMMENT of the iOS simulator's TrustStore.sqlite3, which is what InstallCertificateInIOSSimulators
	COMMENT writes them into.
